    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d241">

                <pb facs="0443" n="437" xml:id="pg437"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Willis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-24"><hi rendition="#italic">November 24,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The brevity and uncertainty of your telegrams are embarrassing. You will insist
                    upon amnesty and recognition of obligations of the Provisional Government as
                    essential conditions of restoration. All interests will be promoted by prompt
                    action.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
